1
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,555
O God, bless the nation of Hungary

2
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,555
With your grace and bounty

3
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:40,555
Extend over it your guarding arm

4
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,555
During strife with its enemies

5
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:56,500
Long torn by ill fate

6
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:04,500
Bring upon it a time of relief

7
00:01:05,500 --> 00:01:12,500
This nation has suffered for all sins

8
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:20,500
<b><i>Of the past and of the future!</i></b>